    "1. In the Accessibility list, select Cubby and click “−” to remove it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. 在「辅助功能」列表中选中 Cubby，点击「−」移除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Come back here, click “Grant Access Again” and turn on Cubby in the list that appears." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. 回到这里点击「重新授权」，在弹出的列表中打开 Cubby"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. If it still doesn't work, run this command in Terminal, then repeat step 2:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. 仍然无效时，可在终端运行下面的命令后重复第 2 步："
          }
        }
      }
    },
